      "body": "These notes close Olympiad Proofs with three reference sections. Return to them when you want to locate an explanation, recall a definition, or check the book's sources.\n\nThe <a href=\"#/learn/olympiad-proofs/p5/2\">Index</a> links key terms to the lessons that teach or use them. The <a href=\"#/learn/olympiad-proofs/p5/3\">Glossary</a> gives definitions and descriptions of those ideas. <a href=\"#/learn/olympiad-proofs/p5/4\">References and Credits</a> records the writing and contest sources, attribution, and further reading.\n\nSearch this book also recognizes indexed terms. Use a search or an index link to return to the mathematical explanation and its worked examples."
